  "notes": "The stable gemini-2.5-pro of 2025-06-17 is the 06-05 preview without changes (developer blog). The experimental gemini-2.5-pro-exp-03-25 was shut down on 2025-06-26, when the 03-25 and 05-06 preview IDs began redirecting to gemini-2.5-pro; the three preview IDs have a shutdown date of 2025-12-02 on the deprecations page. Google's model card calls 2.5 Pro the next iteration in the Gemini 2.0 series. A separate Gemini 2.5 Deep Think model (own model card, 2025-08-01) reached Google AI Ultra subscribers through a toggle on 2.5 Pro in the Gemini app; it is not recorded here. Vertex AI is counted as Google's own API (api)."
